<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Privacy Policy - UChat</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --deep-green: #1B5E20;
    --gold: #FFD700;
    --dark-bg: #0D1B2A;
    --card-bg: #1A1A1A;
    --text-light: #EAEAEA;
    --text-muted: #B0B0B0;
  }

  * {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
    background: var(--dark-bg);
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--deep-green), #123d16);
    padding: 40px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 4px solid var(--gold);
  }

  .header h1 {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .header p {
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 20px 60px;
  }

  .section {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid #2D2D2D;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--deep-green);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 25px 30px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }

  .section h2 {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .section h2 .num {
    background: var(--deep-green);
    color: var(--gold);
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  li {
    padding: 8px 0 8px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #2D2D2D;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  li::before {
    content: "▸";
    color: var(--gold);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
  }

  li strong {
    color: #90EE90;
  }

  .sub-list {
    margin-top: 8px;
    margin-left: 15px;
  }

  .sub-list li::before {
    content: "◦";
  }

  p.desc {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .contact-box {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #123d16, var(--dark-bg));
    border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  }

  .contact-box a {
    color: var(--gold);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .contact-box a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 25px 20px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #2D2D2D;
  }

  footer span {
    color: var(--gold);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="header">
    <h1>Privacy Policy for UChat</h1>
    <p>Last Updated: July 30, 2026</p>
  </div>

  <div class="container">

    <p class="desc">
      UChat ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and share information when you use our mobile application, UChat.
    </p>

    <div class="section">
      <h2><span class="num">1</span> Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> When you sign in using Email, Google, or Phone Number, we collect your basic profile information (like name, email address, or phone number) via Firebase Authentication to identify you within the app.</li>
        <li><strong>Messages and Media:</strong> We process the messages, images, videos, and voice recordings you send to facilitate communication.
          <ul class="sub-list">
            <li><strong>Local Storage:</strong> Your chat history is stored locally on your device using an encrypted database (Room).</li>
            <li><strong>Transmission:</strong> Messages are transmitted in real-time via secure WebSockets (Socket.io).</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li><strong>Contacts:</strong> If you choose to share a contact with a friend, the app accesses your contact list to retrieve the selected contact's details. We do not upload your entire contact list to our servers.</li>
        <li><strong>Audio Data:</strong> We use the microphone permission to allow you to record and send voice messages.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2><span class="num">2</span> How We Use Information</h2>
      <p class="desc">We use the collected data to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide and maintain the UChat messaging service.</li>
        <li>Authenticate users and prevent unauthorized access.</li>
        <li>Enable features like voice messaging and media sharing.</li>
        <li>Improve app performance and fix technical issues.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2><span class="num">3</span> Permissions We Request</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>INTERNET:</strong> To send and receive messages.</li>
        <li><strong>RECORD_AUDIO:</strong> To record voice messages.</li>
        <li><strong>READ_CONTACTS:</strong> To allow you to pick and share contacts with others.</li>
        <li><strong>CAMERA/STORAGE:</strong> To capture and share photos or videos.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2><span class="num">4</span> Data Security</h2>
      <p class="desc" style="margin-bottom:0;">
        We take reasonable measures to protect your data. Your messages are stored locally on your device, and real-time transmission is handled via secure socket connections.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2><span class="num">5</span> Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p class="desc">We use the following third-party services:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Firebase Authentication:</strong> For secure user sign-in.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Play Services:</strong> For app functionality and authentication.</li>
        <li><strong>Socket.io:</strong> For real-time data transmission.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2><span class="num">6</span> Your Rights</h2>
      <p class="desc" style="margin-bottom:0;">
        You can delete your local chat history at any time using the "Clear Chat" option within the app settings.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="section contact-box">
      <h2><span class="num">7</span> Contact Us</h2>
      <p class="desc">If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Email: <a href="mailto:dilshadirshad599@gmail.com">dilshadirshad599@gmail.com</a></li>
        <li>Phone: <a href="tel:+923346177882">+92 334 6177882</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2026 <span>UChat</span>. All rights reserved.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
